SY_TALK("NtJOnsElgCQ",[[5,["First, I‘ll speak in Hindi language"]],[11,["and then in English language."]],[20,["Today we have assembled here to worship Shri Maha Deva,"]],[27,["Shri Shiva Shankar."]],[34,["In the name of Shankarji,"]],[38,["many organizations have come up in this world."]],[42,["Because of Adi Shankaracharya’s emphasis,"]],[47,["worshipping ShivJi became very popular among people."]],[53,["And in South India, two types of sects came up:"]],[58,["one which were called Shaivites,"]],[62,["and the others were called Vaishnavites."]],[66,["Now Shaivites are the worshippers of Lord Shiva,"]],[71,["and the Vaishnavites worship Lord Vishnu."]],[76,["In our country we are experts in creating divisions."]],[82,["We divide the Deities as well;"]],[85,["and when we try to integrate them,"]],[88,["then things become even worse."]],[91,["For example, a new thing has come up, called Ayyappa."]],[95,["It is a very wrong thing."]],[98,["And in that it is shown,"]],[103,["that when Lord Vishnu assumed the form of \"Mohini\","]],[107,["then she got a child from Lord Shiva."]],[111,["How is it even possible?"]],[113,["Such wrong ideas are created and widespread in our country,"]],[118,["and then different beliefs groups are formed based on these ideas."]],[121,["When Indians find some or other reason to fight,"]],[125,["they become very happy."]],[127,["If they have nothing to fight over,"]],[131,["then, they create something from their own imaginations."]],[138,["Actually these two aspects are connected with each other"]],[144,["as sun is with sun light,"]],[149,["word with its meaning, moon with the moonlight."]],[153,["Meaning that the \"Sopan Marga\" which is there,"]],[160,["which we call as Sushumna nadi, which is the central path,"]],[167,["it is the path of Lord Vishnu."]],[170,["And through this path we attain the Shiva tattwa."]],[174,["So the destination is Shiva tattwa, Shri Shiva,"]],[179,["and the path is made by Lord Vishnu."]],[184,["To create this path Shri Vishnu and Shri Adishakti"]],[188,["have done a lot of hardwork."]],[190,["Lord Shiva had no role in it."]],[192,["He sits comfortably in his seat,"]],[194,["not bothering about who is coming or who is not coming."]],[199,["So, to attain this Shiva tattwa,"]],[201,["we should go through this Vishnu path (Sushumna nadi)"]],[204,["and for that, we have to first correct the chakras within us."]],[210,["When the centers are corrected,"]],[212,["our Vishnu path opens up."]],[215,["And along with that, we gradually start ascending."]],[221,["I have told you about all these centers, many a times."]],[224,["But there is a chakra in the heart also, which we call `Left Heart’."]],[229,["This is not a heart chakra in essence,"]],[231,["in a way, heart is the reflection,"]],[238,["the reflection of Shri Mahadeva."]],[242,["The abode of Shiva is above everything,"]],[247,["beyond the mind, beyond the thoughts."]],[251,["To attain this kind of tattwa,"]],[255,["first and foremost we should pay attention"]],[258,["and see how pure our heart is."]],[264,["Inside our heart, we nurture a lot of dirt."]],[271,["For example, we feel jealous of someone."]],[276,["feeling jealous like somebody has been evil to you."]],[283,["Even if they might have harmed you also, troubled you"]],[287,["there is no use becoming jeolous of them."]],[290,["If your heart is clean"]],[292,["then the mirror within you,"]],[295,["in which the God Almighty's reflection is going to fall,"]],[299,["will remain clear."]],[300,["But if you have jealousy within,"]],[306,["then the mirror will not remain clean"]],[308,["and the reflection of God will also not be perfect."]],[311,["To have enmity towards anyone"]],[313,["and to have anger or ill feelings in the heart towards anyone,"]],[321,["is very wrong."]],[323,["That is why Christ said that: \"Forgive everyone\"."]],[328,["To forgive is extremely important."]],[331,["And before and after Christ many saints have said the same thing,"]],[338,["that forgive everybody."]],[339,["The moment you forgive, immediately Lord Shiva,"]],[345,["takes the situation in His hands."]],[348,["The subtlest power of all is that of Shri Mahadev."]],[353,["And He, then completely punishes that person,"]],[360,["totally punishes him."]],[364,["This is the responsibility of Lord Mahadev, not yours."]],[368,["Therefore to be jealous of anyone is very bad."]],[372,["But I find that there is lot of jealousy even in Sahaja Yoga."]],[376,["Sahaja Yogis are jealous of one another."]],[379,["If one person is made trustee, the other one is not,"]],[382,["then he becomes jealous."]],[384,["This trusteeship and all has no meaning,"]],[387,["you all know it is a myth."]],[389,["Your Mother has created all this drama"]],[392,["and has spread a web of maya."]],[394,["Even then the mind of the people gets disturbed;"]],[397,["One person's mind gets disturbed"]],[400,["and for the other the heart gets disturbed!"]],[402,["I do not understand what should I do!"]],[405,["Such a big work is happening in so many countries,"]],[409,["so I can communicate with any one person only, right?"]],[412,["However, things are getting sorted out slowly,"]],[415,["but still you will be surprised"]],[419,["that even now there is lot of discussion"]],[422,["about who is the leader and who is what?"]],[426,["Second thing, there is a so-called \"blessing\" for us, Indians,"]],[435,["that jealousy arises in money matters."]],[440,["Even in Sahaja Yoga there is jealousy on money matters."]],[445,["Someone has got more money and some less."]],[448,["Even while doing Sahaja Yoga work"]],[451,["people see how much money one gets,"]],[454,["and who gives how much money?"]],[456,["If a person's heart gets involved with money"]],[459,["he becomes useless for Sahaja Yoga."]],[463,["Because his heart gets covered with materialism."]],[469,["If any kind of materialism has affected you,"]],[475,["then it is very difficult for you to ascend."]],[478,["This is the speciality of our country."]],[480,["I have not seen it so much in foreign countries."]],[482,["But here it is prominent."]],[485,["I think, in Russia and Eastern Block countries"]],[488,["there is very little of wealth,"]],[490,["but they are not bothered at all."]],[492,["They don't think about money at all."]],[494,["But their heart is so pure, so very pure."]],[498,["And only with the pure heart, devotion (bhakti) is possible."]],[502,["We all, before doing prayers, wash our feet and take bath."]],[507,["But if we bathe our heart"]],[510,["and ask God that whatever negativities are there within us,"]],[516,["to please remove them and purify us,"]],[518,["then it will be much better."]],[521,["Third thing, that is within us,"]],[525,["are the six enemies (shadripu)."]],[528,["Shri Krishna has emphasised that krodha (anger) is the worst thing."]],[532,["Everything emanates from anger."]],[535,["A person shows anger initially,"]],[537,["then he gets into delusion."]],[539,["Then he thinks: \"Why did I say all that, I should not have said it\","]],[542,["and so on."]],[543,["But he goes out of self-control, when he gets angry."]],[546,["In the fit of anger he loses control over himself."]],[550,["He goes out of self-control"]],[552,["and he spits out words, which are meaningless."]],[556,["The dirt he has been accumulating since long in his heart,"]],[560,["comes out of his mouth."]],[564,["We have to beware of this krodha."]],[566,["\"Why does this anger come?\" - we should pay attention to this,"]],[570,["that why do we get angry."]],[572,["There are some who are angry with a particular person,"]],[575,["there are some who are angry with the society."]],[578,["Like this, people get angry in different ways."]],[581,["Why does this anger come to us?"]],[585,["\"Why do we get angry?\" - we should think that."]],[588,["Many people have told Me that,"]],[590,["\"Mother, if someone speaks against You, we get very angry\"."]],[595,["I feel like laughing at this."]],[597,["If anybody talks against Me, then I really feel like laughing."]],[602,["Because it doesn't make any sense. What is there to talk against Me?"]],[606,["I am just sharing my love, even then if they speak against Me,"]],[609,["then what can be done?"]],[610,["But some people have a crooked mind,"]],[613,["so we should only pity them."]],[616,["One should think that such people are big fools."]],[619,["When a person is full of anger, then our attitude towards him,"]],[624,["should be very polite."]],[629,["This attitude may also cool down his anger."]],[632,["In our country there are different kinds of angry people."]],[636,["There are institutions for that"]],[638,["who spread with their anger: \"Hit this person, hit that person\","]],[641,["\"Beat up this person, beat up that person\"."]],[643,["And this is also becoming an issue at the social level."]],[646,["This is a very terrifying situation."]],[650,["To beat and thrash people,"]],[652,["and for that purpose to form an army"]],[657,["or prepare some weapons to beat and hurt people"]],[660,["is very terrifying."]],[662,["However, for protection, a person is equipped with these weapons,"]],[669,["it is not a big deal."]],[671,["However, if he is a devotee of the God Almighty,"]],[674,["he doesn’t require these weapons."]],[676,["This kind of a person is always protected."]],[680,["If Shri Mahadev resides within a person,"]],[685,["who can dare to touch such a person,"]],[688,["who can destroy him?"]],[690,["Whatever you do, however you trouble him,"]],[693,["still that person cannot be destroyed."]],[696,["But those who trouble them, will get destroyed themselves."]],[700,["When you will trust this completely,"]],[703,["that whoever is troubling you, will get destroyed,"]],[707,["then your heart will become totally pure and clean."]],[711,["This work can happen only in a pure heart,"]],[715,["because Shri Shiva exists within us, as reflection,"]],[719,["and only the mirror which is clean deserves to have His reflection."]],[724,["Shiva Ji's anger will happen only once,"]],[727,["or rather people say that He gets angry only once."]],[730,["But I have seen him getting angry many a times,"]],[733,["because it is His right."]],[735,["He has a right to be angry."]],[738,["If anyone works against Shri Adi Shakti,"]],[742,["then Shiv Ji has very long hands."]],[744,["Without listening to anyone, He finishes such a person."]],[748,["Because he knows that Shri Adi Shakti will not do anything Herself."]],[752,["She is not going to punish anyone at all,"]],[756,["and She will forgive everyone."]],[758,["So, His hands are so long,"]],[760,["then there is no limit,"]],[762,["and when those hands start lashing, then nobody can stop them."]],[766,["Who dares to say anything to Him?"]],[768,["He has got His own maryadas,"]],[770,["which you can neither change nor go beyond."]],[776,["You should understand that in your individual life,"]],[781,["in Sahaja Yoga, you have to follow Lord Shiva."]],[786,["Because, if you don't follow Him, firstly,"]],[801,["You will get heart problems."]],[804,["First thing, is that you will get heart disease."]],[808,["It works out in two ways."]],[811,["Firstly with excessive anger the heart catches,"]],[815,["and secondly, after the anger if a person repents,"]],[819,["then he gets the disease called \"angina\"."]],[823,["This is how both the things are useless."]],[827,["But one cannot quit anger, just by saying."]],[829,["This is something like alcohol."]],[831,["It becomes a habit to get angry."]],[833,["He starts relishing it, his face gets puffed up,"]],[836,["he gets extremly angry and no one can control him."]],[839,["So, I thought that if you sit before the mirror"]],[842,["and get angry on yourself,"]],[845,["rebuke yourself with few angry words"]],[848,["and by sitting in front of the mirror if you say:"]],[852,["\"There cannot be a greater fool than me\","]],[854,["then perhaps you may get rid of your anger."]],[858,["I am saying: \"It might be possible\","]],[860,["because at times, these problems are so intricate,"]],[864,["that it is very difficult to solve them."]],[867,["Further, it has been observed"]],[869,["that the more we focus our attention on something"]],[876,["and the more we react to it..."]],[884,["Someone says something and we react instantly to it -"]],[887,["this custom is more in the foreign countries."]],[890,["For example there is a carpet -"]],[892,["immediately they will comment, “I don’t like it!\", \"I like it!”."]],[897,["Who are you to say all this?"]],[899,["Nowadays it's a fashion to say: \"I like it\", \"I don’t like it\"."]],[904,["As if every person is a renowned master,"]],[909,["who goes on saying: `I like it’, `I don’t like it’."]],[912,["This should not be said."]],[914,["Saying this is the indication of your Agnya caught up."]],[917,["What do you think of yourself"]],[919,["that you are saying: \"I like it, I don't like it\"?"]],[924,["You do not have a right to like or dislike any of the things."]],[929,["Supposing, some poor man gives you with affection,"]],[932,["some very beautiful flowers,"]],[935,["and you say: \"Sir, I don't like this flowers\","]],[938,["you are unable to understand the hidden emotions behind this act"]],[943,["because Shiva tattwa is absent in you."]],[946,["Even if it is a very small thing,"]],[949,["which has been given to you by a poor person,"]],[952,["you don't recognise the feeling attached to the emotion,"]],[958,["and how lovingly he has brought that for you."]],[961,["For that in India the example of Sudama has been shown,"]],[965,["that how he arrived with roasted rice to meet Shri Krishna"]],[970,["and how Shri Krishna honoured Him."]],[974,["Anything given with the feeling of love"]],[978,["is like a piece of glass on which when paras (mercury) is applied"]],[981,["it becomes a shining mirror."]],[985,["Similarly, if you have feelings of love for someone,"]],[989,["a very beautiful and good feeling,"]],[991,["but you have no money,"]],[993,["then even if you gift that person a very small thing,"]],[996,["then that person should think:"]],[999,["\"Aha! What an excellent thing it is\"."]],[1001,["This feeling of love"]],[1005,["gives a subtle sight to the person,"]],[1007,["which can be called as artistic,"]],[1010,["artistic qualities emanates from it."]],[1013,["When art is visible from it,"]],[1014,["you start thinking how artistic that thing is."]],[1017,["This art is the art of love, is the art of love."]],[1021,["By this art you can clearly see"]],[1024,["how much love is in that person,"]],[1028,["how affectionate he is, how loving he is,"]],[1031,["what a gentleman he is, what a good person he is."]],[1035,["When you start seeing these qualities in others,"]],[1038,["then you will look within yourself,"]],[1040,["and will start thinking: \"How am I?”"]],[1044,["“Do I have that much love?”,"]],[1046,["“Do I have this gentleman's qualities\"?"]],[1049,["\"Do I have all this goodness within me,"]],[1051,["or am I rendering lip service only?"]],[1055,["And thus misleading the people\"."]],[1058,["Actually we are misleading ourselves only."]],[1061,["When we are doing wrong things, living a wrong lifestyle,"]],[1065,["when our lives are completely filled"]],[1068,["with wrong conceptions,"]],[1070,["then we cannot make anyone happy"]],[1073,["and definitely we cannot be happy as well."]],[1075,["So from the point of view of “swartha”,"]],[1077,["\"swartha\" - this word is very beautiful -"]],[1080,["it means \"to know thy Self\" (swa ka arth)."]],[1082,["\"Swa\" means the Spirit - you must know the meaning of it."]],[1086,["To know the meaning of it people worship Shri Shiva."]],[1089,["But I have seen that the worshipers of Shiva are very hot tempered,"]],[1095,["full of anger, very miserly and what not."]],[1100,["No one is as generous as Shri Shiva,"]],[1103,["no one is as loving as Shri Shiva."]],[1106,["He is the source of love;"]],[1108,["the love which is flowing all around is the leela of His Holy feet."]],[1113,["It is due to Him this work is happening,"]],[1116,["that people are fully immersed in the ocean of love in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1120,["After coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1122,["when you attain the state,"]],[1127,["the state which should be called as Jiva Atma,"]],[1130,["then your attention,"]],[1134,["your attention gets engrossed in the Lotus Feet of Shiv Ji."]],[1139,["And as soon as it gets engrossed in Shri Shiva's Lotus Feet,"]],[1143,["what happens within you,"]],[1147,["is that whatever qualities of the five elements are there,"]],[1152,["they also become very subtle."]],[1155,["I have already told you about the four elements,"]],[1159,["but the fifth one, which is called ‘ether’ in English,"]],[1162,["I didn’t tell you about."]],[1164,["Here it is called \"akash\"."]],[1166,["Akash tattwa is that, when a seeker attains the subtle state,"]],[1172,["then he attains the subtlety of the ether element."]],[1176,["That ”akash” which drives the ether,"]],[1179,["that akash which..."]],[1185,["is self-driven."]],[1188,["If a person has any problem or any trouble,"]],[1193,["then through this omnipresent akash tattwa,"]],[1199,["which is everywhere,"]],[1202,["instantly the effect of your attention reaches where it is required."]],[1208,["It is an amazing thing, but it happens and it happened also."]],[1212,["People may call it miracle, but it is not."]],[1216,["In Sahaja Yoga if your Shiva tatwa is awakened,"]],[1220,["then all the subtle,"]],[1223,["the subtlest of the subtle emotions and state"]],[1231,["get awakened within you."]],[1233,["Therefore it is necessary for us to purify our heart first."]],[1237,["Previously I have talked to you about three enemies."]],[1242,["Now, the fourth enemy present within us is \"madha\"."]],[1247,["\"Madha\" means ego."]],[1251,["When this ego affects the women,"]],[1254,["they start walking like men."]],[1258,["Then they cannot walk like women because of the pride -"]],[1261,["\"I am something very special\" kind of feeling."]],[1263,["Supposing a girl either comes from a very rich family,"]],[1270,["or she is very beautiful,"]],[1272,["or very well educated, whatever is the reason,"]],[1275,["if she gets ego by anything,"]],[1278,["then she starts walking like a man."]],[1284,["And when a man is affected by ego,"]],[1287,["he starts walking like a woman."]],[1290,["Meaning such a man makes himself up,"]],[1293,["for hours sits before the mirror, combs his hair, does this, that"]],[1298,["does all kinds of feminine actions."]],[1301,["To dress up is the job of the women."]],[1303,["While walking also he doesn't walk straight,"]],[1306,["he walks in a peculiar style."]],[1308,["From behind, if you see him,"]],[1309,["you will feel as if a lady is walking in a male dress."]],[1315,["So, when a man"]],[1318,["gets intoxicated with this ego (madha),"]],[1323,["then he is completely lost in his own world."]],[1326,["In his ego, he starts swaying like an elephant."]],[1330,["All his actions become different."]],[1333,["Whether they talk or don't talk, the way they sit -"]],[1338,["in every action it is evident"]],[1341,["that they have some kind of ego within them."]],[1344,["It is difficult to understand the cause of their ego,"]],[1347,["what makes them think that they are special."]],[1350,["All these things are petty things."]],[1353,["They have no meaning at all."]],[1355,["In Sahaja Yoga they have no meaning at all."]],[1358,["And so that is why"]],[1361,["to believe in these kind of things,"]],[1364,["that \"we are something special\","]],[1366,["then you just end up to be worse than ordinary."]],[1368,["You do not remain extraordinary, you become worse than ordinary."]],[1371,["It means that it's not wise to have any imagination about yourself,"]],[1376,["that \"I am very rich\" or \"I am something great\"."]],[1379,["Now even the poor people suffer from ego."]],[1382,["Even the dalits have become egoistical, it's beyond understanding."]],[1386,["People talk as if they are something very great."]],[1390,["What are you as an individual?"]],[1392,["A devotee of God Almighty."]],[1396,["You are Sahaja Yogis, who believe in God."]],[1401,["To think about yourself that you are something great,"]],[1405,["is to go away from the state of joy (anand),"]],[1407,["because the power of Shiva gives the state of joy to the seeker."]],[1411,["To get absorbed in the state of joy,"]],[1415,["people worship Lord Shiva."]],[1417,["But I have seen that most of the Shiva bhaktas"]],[1420,["are quite grumpy people -"]],[1422,["no one can talk to them."]],[1424,["What is the use?"]],[1425,["They worship Shri Shiva who is verily Natraj,"]],[1428,["from whom emanate all forms of art,"]],[1432,["who is extremely joyful,"]],[1434,["who is the embodiment of \"anand\"."]],[1437,["In front of Him, how could these people be called His bhaktas?"]],[1441,["They hang such a big linga around their neck,"]],[1443,["which could give them a heart attack."]],[1445,["What is the need for that?"]],[1447,["You can yourself become the \"linga swarupa\"."]],[1449,["Without becoming that,"]],[1451,["they claim: \"We are Shiva bhaktas\","]],[1456,["and start fighting after worshipping Shri Shiva."]],[1458,["And they have different marks."]],[1461,["Shiva bhaktas will put mark across the forehead,"]],[1464,["and Vishnu bhaktas will put the mark along the forehead."]],[1468,["Oh! What does this mean?"]],[1471,["Vertical application means that you are ascending - alright!"]],[1475,["You are ascending"]],[1477,["and once you reach that state you should become peaceful."]],[1481,["The mark should be applied both ways, or not be applied at all."]],[1484,["It should have some meaning,"]],[1486,["that those who are trying to achieve Shri Shiva,"]],[1489,["should go through the central path (\"Sopan marg\")."]],[1492,["While passing through this path,"]],[1494,["you have to leave behind all the negativities."]],[1498,["Before criticizing others, learn to criticize yourself."]],[1504,["Say it to yourself: \"I am like this, I am like that\"."]],[1508,["When you start critisizing yourself,"]],[1510,["then you will see that all the bhoots will run away."]],[1513,["Because we have gathered all these negativities,"]],[1516,["by our continuous thought process, by our Agnya."]],[1519,["By the excessive use of Agnya,"]],[1521,["we start accumulating negative forces,"]],[1523,["everything transforms into a mental projection"]],[1525,["and such a person becomes troublesome and creates misery."]],[1529,["And that misery makes him also miserable."]],[1533,["By giving unhappiness to others, you can never be happy."]],[1536,["It will have its impact on you even if you are a stone."]],[1539,["It will have its impact"]],[1541,["and the impact is such that the person becomes unhappy."]],[1548,["As far as a Mother is concerned,"]],[1550,["She always thinks of your welfare."]],[1554,["She thinks what makes you happy,"]],[1556,["what gives you contentment,"]],[1558,["what gives you peace of mind."]],[1560,["what can give you love"]],[1562,["and what makes you become a saintly person in this world."]],[1566,["This is the method of the Mother,"]],[1568,["but this is not Shri Shiva's method."]],[1571,["He tolerates upto a certain limit and then deals so severely"]],[1574,["that I get terrified that what is going to happen to that person."]],[1579,["Where shall he reach? What is he going to do?"]],[1581,["Shri Shiva doesn't think that."]],[1583,["It is not in His nature to think that:"]],[1587,["\"Even if he is very bad and evil, I will forgive him!\"."]],[1593,["Yes, if the person is worthy of His forgiveness, then He forgives."]],[1597,["And those who meditate upon Him and do lot of penance,"]],[1600,["He blesses them with boons."]],[1603,["But that person who, basically, does not want to correct himself,"]],[1611,["Lord Shiva sets him right."]],[1612,["It is a fact."]],[1614,["That’s why we should be scared of Him as He is called ”Bhayankar” (Terrifying)."]],[1617,["When He gets angry then He does not forgive anyone."]],[1621,["But His worst anger comes during the doomsday,"]],[1626,["what we call: \"the night when the whole creation will be finished\"."]],[1631,["At that time, He will destroy everything with his anger."]],[1635,["That time, as I have told you, is the Last Judgement."]],[1641,["During this time which path you take to, where you go,"]],[1645,["whatever you do,"]],[1647,["all these things are completely stored within you."]],[1654,["Every small detail about you is recorded"]],[1657,["and accordingly you are sent either to Heaven or to Hell."]],[1663,["It is Lord Shiva who sends people to Hell, not Me."]],[1667,["I have nothing to do with the Hell (Naraka)."]],[1669,["But Lord Shiva has."]],[1671,["He will pull you by your legs and throw you in the Hell."]],[1674,["Then you cannot say that \"I am the worshipper of the Mother,"]],[1678,["and I am the follower of Mother, then why is this happening to me?\"."]],[1684,["I am not instrumental in that."]],[1686,["Once someone calls Me Mother, then I can not think ill of him."]],[1691,["But, If I am the maryada for Shri Shiva"]],[1695,["then He is my maryada (limit) too."]],[1697,["But, in this regard since we both are totally opposite in nature,"]],[1702,["you have to be very careful."]],[1706,["And the eleven Rudras present in Christ"]],[1709,["are also the manifestation of Shri Shiva."]],[1711,["The emotions of the Rudras are the form of Lord Shiva,"]],[1714,["that is why, you have to be very careful."]],[1720,["Regarding this I have to warn you,"]],[1723,["because even in Sahaja Yoga some people come to earn money,"]],[1728,["some talk ill of others, some do wrong things,"]],[1731,["some do injustice."]],[1733,["Such persons are sieved out of the stream."]],[1736,["But as soon as they are out, they get into the orbit of Lord Shiva."]],[1739,["Then I get the news that they have gone bankrupt,"]],[1742,["this happened, that happened. I say: \"Now don't tell Me this\"."]],[1746,["They themselves came out of His protection,"]],[1749,["then who could save them?"]],[1752,["So, you should try to seek your protection in Lord Shiva."]],[1758,["Of course, you are protected by Mother,"]],[1760,["but you should seek also Lord Shiva's protection."]],[1762,["For that, I told you about the five elements."]],[1767,["The subtelty of these five elements should be attained by you."]],[1772,["And to achieve that state you should meditate regularly."]],[1779,["Those who meditate, look totally different"]],[1782,["and those who do not meditate also look different in another way,"]],[1786,["no doubt about it."]],[1788,["Now those who meditate but they are not willing to do it,"]],[1791,["whose attention is not there in meditation,"]],[1793,["those who do not have understanding or discretion for meditation,"]],[1797,["and they have a kind of laziness towards it,"]],[1801,["then that meditation is not fruitful,"]],[1805,["one does not get any benefit from it."]],[1807,["Meditation should be such"]],[1810,["that each and every cell of your body gets filled with joy"]],[1815,["and bliss showers over you."]],[1817,["Lord Shiva's first and most important blessing"]],[1826,["is that He gives you joy, He fills your being with happiness."]],[1831,["Even only by chanting His name,"]],[1835,["a person should become joyous."]],[1839,["But instead people always behave in an opposite way."]],[1843,["I feel surprised that nothing is as expected,"]],[1848,["that the people whom we think to be Shiva bhaktas (devotees),"]],[1851,["how could they be such dry personalities?"]],[1856,["Not possible at all."]],[1858,["There is one more reason for it."]],[1860,["Those who are always busy working, too busy,"]],[1866,["they become right sided."]],[1868,["When they become too much right sided,"]],[1870,["they get devoid of Lord Shiva."]],[1873,["They move away from Lord Shiva;"]],[1875,["and then Shri Shiva shows His power."]],[1879,["Now you know that Shri Saraswati is the sister of Lord Shiva."]],[1883,["The worshippers of Shri Saraswati,"]],[1885,["I mean the people who read and write, who gather knowledge,"]],[1891,["and apart from that, who are interested in art,"]],[1897,["who are genuine art lovers,"]],[1899,["this kind of people who worship Shri Saraswati, pay homage to Her,"]],[1904,["they should know first of all that She is Shri Shiva's sister"]],[1909,["and you know that sister's relationship is very powerful."]],[1913,["If you try to deceit His sister,"]],[1917,["adopt any bad qualities or talk ill of Her -"]],[1922,["for example, many people write impure literature or bad books,"]],[1925,["many people have knowledge, but they distort it -"]],[1929,["this kind of people cannot escape the wrath of Shri Shiva."]],[1934,["Because His sister is very important."]],[1938,["And to deceive Her is the greatest sin."]],[1942,["In His view, it is a very big sin."]],[1945,["And regarding Shri Adi Shakti His protocols are equally rigid,"]],[1951,["there is no doubt about that."]],[1953,["Please check this mike. It is falling off."]],[1958,["And now, Sahaja Yogis,"]],[1962,["first of all have to pay attention towards themselves."]],[1966,["I do not mean that they should sit before the mirror for hours."]],[1969,["Not at all."]],[1971,["Sitting before the mirror all the time, is also considered a disease."]],[1975,["I mean to say that you should have attention towards your Self,"]],[1979,["look at yourself and see: \"What are the problems within me\"?"]],[1985,["“What wrong things am I doing?”."]],[1988,["In our Indian culture,"]],[1991,["the straight path, which has been suggested, should be taken."]],[1995,["In this time a new era has come,"]],[1998,["in which people think they can live as they want, but it is not so."]],[2002,["Being in India,"]],[2004,["you have to be in total harmony with the Indian culture."]],[2009,["Your life style should remain connected to lndian culture,"]],[2014,["because in our culture, Shiva tattwa is given great importance."]],[2019,["Most important of all is Shiva tattwa."]],[2021,["And Shiva tattwa only has created our \"maryadas\"."]],[2026,["The moment you cross these maryadas, you are finished."]],[2031,["All these maryadas which are in our culture"]],[2034,["are because of the grace of Lord Shiva."]],[2037,["Whatever has been told to us so far: \"Don't do this, don't do that\","]],[2043,["everything big and small,"]],[2045,["these maryadas (boundaries) have been laid by Lord Shiva."]],[2048,["He is so much concerned about His maryadas"]],[2052,["that the moment you step over these boundaries,"]],[2057,["you get affected."]],[2060,["Now, in the name of Shiva tattwa,"]],[2062,["people have created so many wrong ideas."]],[2065,["Like many people think that taking \"bhaang\" (an intoxicating drink)"]],[2069,["can awaken Shiva tattwa."]],[2071,["Many others who consume liquor think"]],[2074,["that drinking alcohol submerges you in Shiva tattwa!"]],[2078,["Many wrong ideas of this type have been created by people,"]],[2082,["that this kind of acts are all right for Shri Shiva,"]],[2085,["because He has done that."]],[2087,["Shri Shiva drank poison also."]],[2090,["Would you also drink poison?"]],[2093,["He drank poison to make the whole world free from it."]],[2099,["That is why He used to eat \"dhatura\" (jimsonweed),"]],[2103,["because \"dhatura\" contains poison."]],[2106,["Similarly you might have heard"]],[2109,["that Sai Nath used plenty of tobacco."]],[2114,["He used to fill it in a pipe and inhale the smoke."]],[2118,["The reason was that most people in Maharashtra are tobacco addicts."]],[2123,["A minister also will consume tobacco"]],[2125,["and his servant will also consume it."]],[2127,["And the minister will ask a servant: \"Give me tobacco if you have\"."]],[2133,["To this great extent there people are used to tobacco"]],[2137,["although tobacco is not grown here, in Maharashtra."]],[2140,["But somehow they are crazy for tobacco."]],[2144,["To such great extent people consume tobacco in Maharashtra."]],[2147,["To free people of this addiction Sainath thought:"]],[2151,["\"Why don't I consume all the tobacco?\"."]],[2155,["That is why He used to inhale tobacco."]],[2158,["But people started saying: \"Sainath is smoking, so we also can do\"."]],[2162,["Because of these kind of people, He used to consume tobacco"]],[2166,["so that the tobacco addiction of these people will come to an end."]],[2171,["Now, whatever you call it, tobacco is tobacco,"]],[2176,["and there is no connection between Lord Shiva and tobacco"]],[2180,["but definitely He wanted to destroy it from the whole world."]],[2187,["Now supposing we take the example of Goddess"]],[2190,["and the job of the Goddess is to eat all the bhoots,"]],[2195,["so would you also eat bhoots?"]],[2198,["Also the job of the Goddess is"]],[2200,["to absorb whatever diseases you have."]],[2209,["So, would you dare to do that?"]],[2212,["This is not your job."]],[2214,["Similarly, whatever the saints and sages have done,"]],[2219,["you neither have the power to do it right now,"]],[2223,["nor it is your job."]],[2225,["Your job is to cleanse yourself,"]],[2228,["to correct yourself and first attain that state."]],[2232,["Then all the other matters will be alright."]],[2234,["But if you don't reach that state, it is useless."]],[2238,["For you, doing all these rituals is a waste."]],[2242,["There are many things,"]],[2244,["which can be justified wrongly."]],[2250,["But if we have to go in the right direction, walk on the right path,"]],[2255,["then first of all we have to purify our hearts."]],[2259,["All these habits that we are addicted to,"]],[2262,["these habits also altogether"]],[2267,["affect our heart."]],[2269,["So in the olden times, it so happened,"]],[2272,["that all the disciples who came, were made to sleep in jungles."]],[2286,["They used to live in jungles among the snakes, scorpions"]],[2291,["spiders and all other animals,"]],[2295,["so that they do not get addicted to a luxurious life."]],[2300,["At the most they could sleep in huts,"]],[2303,["which were covered with cow dung."]],[2307,["They used to live a very simple life and wear minimal clothes,"]],[2312,["so that children do not become crazy about clothes."]],[2317,["\"We want to wear these cloths, those shoes, we want this food\" -"]],[2323,["Sahaja Yogis should not say all this."]],[2325,["You know that your Mother can live anywhere,"]],[2328,["can sleep anywhere, can eat any food."]],[2331,["So Indians have a craze for taste within -"]],[2334,["all the people here are very fond of eating."]],[2340,["Sahaja Yogis also invite each other for having food together."]],[2346,["Ladies particularly have to say, wherever I go,"]],[2350,["\"Mother, come to our house to have some food\"."]],[2352,["My food habits are very different."]],[2355,["I cannot eat in a hotel, I cannot eat anywhere."]],[2359,["Even in my own house I eat without salt and sugar."]],[2363,["I am not bothered about taste since childhood."]],[2367,["I eat whatever is available."]],[2369,["But Indian tongues are very fond of spicy and tangy tastes."]],[2374,["Whether they are from from U.P., from Punjab or from South,"]],[2380,["in the matter of eating, Indians are great experts."]],[2385,["And women befool the men by serving them good food."]],[2391,["\"My husband is fond of this food, my husband is fond of that food\""]],[2397,["What to do?"]],[2398,["Women will be slaves to their husbands and try to please them."]],[2401,["If they keep talking about food day and night,"]],[2404,["then they are not Sahaja Yogis."]],[2407,["And when I was there in Milan,"]],[2411,["during the program of Guru puja,"]],[2415,["I Myself cooked the food. What to do?"]],[2417,["For four years I Myself cooked there,"]],[2419,["because no one else prepared tasty food."]],[2422,["People would say: \"Mother, it tastes just like plastic\"."]],[2425,["In particular, the Indians."]],[2427,["All the Indians who come there for Puja, have to meet Me,"]],[2431,["as if they have special right over Me."]],[2433,["Also they are very critical about the food,"]],[2436,["that the food served here is not good."]],[2438,["Now one more new thing has begun among Indians,"]],[2441,["that they want attached bathrooms."]],[2445,["Their bathrooms, if you go to their houses and see,"]],[2449,["how their parents lived there..."]],[2451,["Now, they want attached bathroom, that too western style."]],[2455,["I am mentioning this today, because I am tired of it."]],[2459,["In Ganapatipule, I provided western bathrooms separately for them."]],[2465,["At first I provided Indian toilets,"]],[2468,["thinking that Indians will like Indian style."]],[2471,["And I provided foreign people with western style."]],[2474,["But then Indians said: \"We also need western bathrooms\"."]],[2477,["Now what is this?"]],[2478,["I said: \"Now a strike is going to start here\"."]],[2481,["I said: \"Take tumblers and go to jungle, that is what you deserve\"."]],[2487,["For years together they have been going like this,"]],[2489,["but now they have become great sahabs and want attached bathrooms."]],[2495,["Poor western people, poor foreigners who came from abroad said:"]],[2500,["\"Mother, we prefer Indian style, because they are very clean."]],[2504,["So give us Indian bathrooms only\"."]],[2506,["Then I changed the arrangement"]],[2508,["and Indians were very happy that they got attached bathrooms."]],[2512,["You should be ashamed of it."]],[2515,["Sahaja Yogis should be ashamed talking about such things."]],[2518,["Your forefathers used to go to jungle with tumblers"]],[2520,["so why do you have this new craze?"]],[2522,["Do you have some disease or any other problem?"]],[2526,["They put Me in great trouble."]],[2528,["But somehow it struck Me that:"]],[2530,["\"Okay, you take this and you take that\"."]],[2536,["This kind of giving excuses and doing such things,"]],[2539,["is something only Indians do."]],[2542,["You will be surprised, people who come to Cabella,"]],[2545,["all of them stay with one another,"]],[2548,["though they are very rich people, they have cars and everything,"]],[2551,["still they would sleep in the pendal."]],[2553,["But Indians will have a special place for themselves,"]],[2557,["they will stay in hotels and roam around in cars."]],[2559,["They do not have, even to a small extent,"]],[2562,["any kind of sacrificing attitude."]],[2566,["They have not learnt how to sacrifice."]],[2569,["The way we became so modern nowadays, it's beyond My understanding."]],[2574,["Now, there are no servants in foreigners' houses."]],[2578,["So, they have no attached bath,"]],[2580,["they have only one bathroom, because they only have to clean it."]],[2583,["You all have servants, so you can afford even ten bathrooms."]],[2588,["But all these things are taking you away from your own powers."]],[2594,["Your attention is going in useless things."]],[2597,["Frittering away of the attention in absurdities,"]],[2600,["all this will make you a very ordinary human being."]],[2607,["Among women, it is fashion nowadays to go to beauty parlours."]],[2611,["Their face remains the same."]],[2612,["They will spend money there, do this here and do that there."]],[2616,["In Pune, the wife of brahmins"]],[2619,["will wear sleeveless dresses, use goggles"]],[2623,["and roam around in a moped."]],[2626,["I don't understand it."]],[2629,["In Pune, which is punya-pattanam (land of good deeds)."]],[2631,["Is this the way to do good deeds?"]],[2635,["We are adopting to western style in such a way,"]],[2638,["without thinking where is Shiva tattwa in this?"]],[2644,["Look at Shri Shiva,"]],[2646,["He sits comfortably with minimal clothes."]],[2648,["In His marriage procession also He sat upon Nandi and went."]],[2652,["Why Nandi? Because Nandi is His disciple."]],[2655,["Whatever He says, Nandi will nod his head."]],[2658,["He can tell Nandi anything, that's why he is His dearest disciple."]],[2663,["Now, He sat upon Nandi and arrived at His wedding venue."]],[2668,["So, Parvati Ji had no objection,"]],[2671,["but Her brother, Shri Vishnu got a little worried:"]],[2673,["\"Why is the bridegroom coming in this manner?\"."]],[2677,["I do not mean that you become this kind of a groom,"]],[2681,["I don't mean that, but still, to overdo things"]],[2686,["and spending unnecessarily is of no use."]],[2691,["Be sensible."]],[2693,["Wisdom is your ornament."]],[2697,["To accept everything, whatever is there, is alright."]],[2700,["Food - alright."]],[2702,["Now, if they go to someone's house for food,"]],[2704,["they will keep critisizing the host."]],[2707,["May not be in front of them but back home they'll say:"]],[2709,["\"What kind of food was that?\"."]],[2711,["If the host cooked good, then they demand same food in their house."]],[2717,["The whole day attention is on taste of the tongue -"]],[2720,["it is too much in India, beyond the limit."]],[2725,["This kind attention should be reduced."]],[2727,["The foreign yogis eat Indian food. I've never heard any complaint."]],[2732,["Although, you can never eat their western food."]],[2742,["But the way you have coated yourself with these things,"]],[2747,["will not let you get into the deeper joy."]],[2750,["To achieve the joy of Lord Shiva,"]],[2756,["it is said that you have to renounce everything."]],[2759,["First renounce the world,"]],[2761,["go to Himalayas and stand on one leg."]],[2764,["Wear minimal clothes."]],[2767,["Take a dip in the river and then meditate in wet clothes."]],[2771,["They used to torture the body in every possible way."]],[2773,["Even these days gurus beat their disciples."]],[2776,["They trouble them a lot."]],[2778,["They don't give Realisation so easily, no way."]],[2781,["After going through lot of troubles,"]],[2784,["then the disciples get Realization,"]],[2787,["but their Realization establishes in them, strongly."]],[2793,["Instead, you all have got Realization easily"]],[2796,["but your past things are still lingering in your brain."]],[2801,["These problems are still with you."]],[2803,["Now what to do with them?"]],[2805,["They need to be shaken off."]],[2807,["All these things which we have accumulated"]],[2809,["need to be pushed away, totally finished."]],[2811,["And for that there is no need to make a show,"]],[2813,["renounce the world or leave the home and family."]],[2817,["Any kind of \"Dravidi Pranayama\" (breathing technique) is not required."]],[2823,["But one thing is a must,"]],[2827,["your temptation of the taste should be reduced,"]],[2830,["should be reduced gradually."]],[2834,["You should become oblivious of taste."]],[2836,["It is very important."]],[2838,["Oblivion to the taste is a great quality."]],[2841,["People get enraged if they do not get food of their choice."]],[2844,["They throw away their plates, beat their servants and what not?"]],[2850,["If you can conquer your tongue,"]],[2855,["then many sweet shops may close down, in My opinion."]],[2860,["However, I mean to say"]],[2865,["that the body should not be given much importance."]],[2868,["If the body needs comfort,"]],[2870,["like you want to sleep on a bed and can't sleep on the ground,"]],[2874,["then for ten days sleep on the ground."]],[2876,["How can you not sleep like that?"]],[2878,["You should not give up until you have enslaved your body."]],[2881,["Your attention should go away from your comfort."]],[2885,["There are many people who cannot travel by bus,"]],[2889,["because they can only go by car."]],[2893,["Then they ask for a car from here, there,"]],[2896,["sit in this car, sit in that car..."]],[2898,["But none of them will think:"]],[2900,["\"Come, let me travel by bus today and see what happens?\""]],[2904,["And earlier there were no buses also, so people used to walk."]],[2907,["When we were in school, we used to walk five miles daily,"]],[2910,["though we had car and everything."]],[2913,["Such parents we had."]],[2917,["But we ourselves were very fond of walking barefoot,"]],[2920,["without shoes, carrying slippers in our hand."]],[2924,["Because of the vibrations it was good to walk on the earth."]],[2927,["You should also start walking without shoes and slippers sometimes."]],[2932,["It is very important and very beneficial."]],[2935,["Mother Earth will get vibrations and you will also feel nice."]],[2939,["In everything, we have become excessively comfort loving people."]],[2944,["We have become just like the few Nawabs of earlier days."]],[2948,["And what did we get? We can get nothing from that."]],[2951,["We will waste our whole lives by being enslaved to these things."]],[2955,["We have to reduce this slavery,"]],[2957,["and establish within us the essence (tattwa) of Param Shiva."]],[2961,["And for that it is essential that everything else becomes unimportant."]],[2966,["Today wear this, tomorrow wear that,"]],[2969,["and that will match with this dress and so on."]],[2972,["Whatever is available accept it."]],[2975,["Whatever comes your way wear that."]],[2978,["It is not a problem,"]],[2979,["you will not get in any trouble because of that."]],[2982,["On the contrary you will be happy that you are a contented person:"]],[2986,["\"Whatever I got, I accepted with content\"."]],[2990,["Nowadays in our Nagpur,"]],[2993,["I don't know if the situation is same here as well,"]],[2995,["the price of the gas cylinder has gone up by Rs. 16."]],[2999,["Then the photos of protesting women came in the newspaper,"]],[3002,["all well dressed, with heavy make-up."]],[3004,["I said that their powder itself must be worth Rs. 15."]],[3012,["These people think: \"If others are going for strike,"]],[3016,["then we are also joining\"."]],[3017,["What for?"]],[3019,["Because the price increased by Rs. 15."]],[3021,["Can't you see that your salary has also increased?"]],[3025,["Earlier, supposing, we were paying Rs. 20-25  to our servants,"]],[3030,["today we pay Rs. 2500."]],[3033,["He also complains, though he gets clothes and other things also."]],[3037,["Salaries have increased so much, then would the prices not increase?"]],[3041,["Where the salaries increase, prices also go up."]],[3044,["It is told that in Lanka (tr.n. fom Ramayana)"]],[3048,["there were gold bricks, as currency."]],[3051,["Now, one person went to get gold bricks."]],[3054,["He found that, after working for one day"]],[3057,["he recieved two gold bricks."]],[3059,["After that he went to a barber shop for shave."]],[3063,["He asked the barber: “What are the charges?” “Two bricks”."]],[3067,["As the income, so the expenses."]],[3069,["It is a matter of discretion."]],[3071,["What is the point in grumbling over the price rise, this and that?"]],[3074,["They all do this even to Me."]],[3077,["How much has your salary increased?"]],[3080,["Very, very much! Then?"]],[3082,["Then why to keep crying about the inflation?"]],[3084,["When the salary increases, price increase is bound to happen."]],[3087,["Your salary increases and prices remain the same, how is it possible?"]],[3091,["It's a very simple thing, if we learn this,"]],[3094,["then socially also we could achieve Shiva tattwa."]],[3099,["Now, Gandhiji was an amazing person."]],[3102,["I was in his ashram with him."]],[3105,["I was not bothered at all, but others used to cry."]],[3108,["Because his principle was,"]],[3111,["that all the people had to clean everbody's bathroom,"]],[3113,["the guests' bathroom and everyone's."]],[3116,["And there was no sweeper at all."]],[3120,["Wash your own clothes, wash your own plates."]],[3123,["And the meal consisted of boiled food with mustard oil on top of it."]],[3129,["Now, tell Me how many Indians can eat that type of food?"]],[3133,["People used to stay there for 2-3 days and then run away."]],[3136,["This was the situation."]],[3138,["Now, you people also should learn to less bother about the taste."]],[3141,["Now, as far as oblivion to taste is concerned,"]],[3144,["I don't know how I can do it,"]],[3146,["but you can try to eat only boiled food for a few days."]],[3160,["No mother would say such a thing to her children."]],[3163,["But what can I do? It is damaging your Shiva tattwa."]],[3166,["If all of your attention is on eating and drinking,"]],[3168,["then your Shiva tattwa will disappear"]],[3170,["and all the efforts will go to waste."]],[3173,["So, to get involved too much in eating, is not good."]],[3179,["In olden days, people used to fast for a day or two."]],[3182,["Something or the other they used to sacrifice from their side."]],[3188,["But nowadays it is very difficult to say,"]],[3190,["that if you become contented, become satisfied,"]],[3194,["then it is not necessary for you, absolutely not required,"]],[3198,["to talk all the time about eating and drinking"]],[3202,["and invite others for supper."]],[3204,["Then, in India we have caste system."]],[3208,["Kayasth are separate,"]],[3210,["Hindu brahmins are separate and others are separate, even now."]],[3215,["Now what happens,"]],[3217,["is that all the kayashth Sahaja Yogis form one group,"]],[3219,["brahmin Sahaja Yogis form another group."]],[3221,["Now you all have become Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3224,["then why are you still worried about all this brahminism?"]],[3226,["Then kayasth will invite other kayasths for a meal."]],[3230,["And brahmins will invite other brahmins for a meal."]],[3232,["If you have to do this kind of stupidity,"]],[3235,["then why did you come to Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3237,["There is no caste and creed in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3240,["When you cannot drop this fundamentally wrong thing,"]],[3244,["then what else can you drop?"]],[3247,["Did Shiv Ji bother about caste and creed?"]],[3249,["Even someone with a blind eye,"]],[3252,["someone with broken leg, someone with broken hands,"]],[3255,["all kind of deformed people"]],[3258,["accompanied Him in His marriage procession."]],[3260,["So when Shiva tattwa is like this it is wrong for you to be critical"]],[3268,["and say: \"I am very particular that the food should be like this\"."]],[3275,["And then separate food for kayasth, separate for brahmins,"]],[3278,["separate for other casts and separate for rajputs,"]],[3281,["separate for everyone:"]],[3283,["\"Now, we want only that food\"."]],[3285,["I have never understood, till now I could not understand,"]],[3289,["if there is more pleasure in eating different foods,"]],[3293,["then why do these people ask only for a particular type of food."]],[3297,["What is the reason? For bengalies, bengali food,"]],[3301,["for madrasis, madrasi food."]],[3304,["Once I asked in our Airforce, I mean in the Airlines:"]],[3309,["\"Why there is no good standard food?”."]],[3311,["They said: \"Mother, tell us what is India's standard food?\"."]],[3317,["This is very true."]],[3319,["If you prepare some food, they will say: \"This is Madrasi food\"."]],[3322,["Madrasi will say: \"This is Bihari food\", this and that and that."]],[3328,["So, that's why you should eat all types of food."]],[3335,["Because everything starts from here itself."]],[3338,["This Vaikhari, your speech,"]],[3340,["in your speech as well, there should be sweetness,"]],[3344,["there should be madhurya."]],[3346,["In the smiles also, it feels sometimes,"]],[3349,["as if Ravana is emerging out of the mouth."]],[3353,["Then what can be said about the way they talk?"]],[3355,["And when they talk, it feels as if Chandika is talking."]],[3360,["Women particularly create this fuss."]],[3363,["Even men do it."]],[3366,["Various weird things have come up letely."]],[3369,["Where is Shiva tattwa in this?"]],[3374,["Lord Shiva is the ocean of love."]],[3378,["He bestows boons even on rakshasas."]],[3383,["Shri Shiva who has bestowed boons even on rakshasas -"]],[3387,["if we have to awaken His tattawa within us,"]],[3389,["then how could we get entangled in petty matters like these?"]],[3394,["How can we do this? Tell me."]],[3397,["The way we criticize each other,"]],[3401,["some say \"He is superior\", some say \"He is inferior\","]],[3405,["it is not like Lord Shiva."]],[3408,["The streams of love are flowing within Lord Shiva."]],[3413,["And while flowing in these streams of love –"]],[3416,["you should not say such baseless things."]],[3422,["There is no use of it."]],[3426,["Mutual love,"]],[3428,["mutual understanding"]],[3430,["and the company of each other should be enjoyed."]],[3437,["Now definitely,"]],[3438,["Sahaja Yogis do not fight with each other, I have seen that."]],[3442,["And when they meet each other, they meet with love."]],[3445,["But still, even now very petty matters, which are very personal,"]],[3449,["like eating, drinking, moving around and other daily activities,"]],[3453,["need to be corrected."]],[3456,["If we correct them it will be wonderful."]],[3459,["Your attention will go towards your heart,"]],[3463,["and will not remain in these things,"]],[3466,["will not remain in these matters."]],[3468,["This disease is more in foreign countries."]],[3471,["That's why many enterpreneurs are popping up"]],[3475,["and they manufacture various kinds of things."]],[3478,["And those who wear such things start thinking very high of themselves."]],[3484,["Particularly in Italy this is quite popular."]],[3488,["But you should not get caught in all these things."]],[3493,["You should lead a simple life."]],[3496,["In our country, people who lead a simple life"]],[3500,["have attained great heights."]],[3503,["Others cannot achieve this."]],[3506,["In the olden days when Gandhiji asked everyone to wear khadi cloth,"]],[3510,["everyone obeyed and wore khadi."]],[3513,["He made such a rule"]],[3516,["and set everybody right."]],[3519,["But now you have to set yourself right."]],[3522,["Because you yourself are the light of the Spirit,"]],[3527,["you youreself have come under the protection of Shri Shiva."]],[3534,["You have to correct yourself on your own."]],[3537,["You don't need to correct others,"]],[3539,["but just correct yourself"]],[3541,["and feel blessed that you are a Self Realized person."]],[3544,["How many were there earlier?"]],[3546,["Only a few of them and people used to kill them as well."]],[3549,["Today you are in thousands, so start doing this."]],[3554,["Sweetness in your talk,"]],[3556,["not superficially but from the heart."]],[3558,["Whatever you say from your heart, never hurts anyone."]],[3563,["So you talk from your heart,"]],[3565,["with children, with elderly people,"]],[3568,["following the \"maryadas\" of good conduct."]],[3570,["When you make yourself happy,"]],[3574,["you will make others happy as well."]],[3577,["But, if the blessing of Shri Shiva is missing within you,"]],[3583,["which makes you content,"]],[3586,["nothing else can make you content."]],[3588,["So pay attention to yourself and see: \"Am I content or not?"]],[3593,["Do I have satisfaction or not?"]],[3595,["Do I get angry with others over small, small things"]],[3601,["or do I find faults with them?"]],[3604,["Then definitely there is something wrong with me\"."]],[3607,["And only after seeing these faults, you can get cleansed."]],[3611,["Until you see something, how can you clean it?"]],[3616,["This cleansing is much needed."]],[3618,["And only by this cleansing,"]],[3620,["you can have the \"darshan\" of God Almighty within yourself."]],[3626,["And all the people can have His \"darshan\" as well."]],[3629,["Wish you have infinite blessings."]],[3645,["It's a very long lecture I have given in Hindi language"]],[3648,["and because there are very few, also, Sahaja Yogis from abroad."]],[3654,["What I was telling them was that about the principle of Shiva"]],[3659,["is in your heart,"]],[3662,["and that reflection is not on a chakra, but on a… like a mirror."]],[3668,["Now, whatever is visible of you"]],[3674,["is this mirror."]],[3676,["In this mirror, what reflection you have?"]],[3680,["Do you have a reflection, which is clear, clean?"]],[3685,["Have you cleaned your heart?"]],[3687,["Have you cleaned your mirror that is reflecting?"]],[3694,["That is what one has to see."]],[3697,["Now, what I told them at length was this,"]],[3700,["that how there are six enemies we have got."]],[3705,["And all these six enemies, one after another, try to corrupt us."]],[3711,["Out of that, I have told them about five."]],[3714,["The sixth one doesn’t exist much in India, which we call as lust,"]],[3719,["it's much less."]],[3721,["But, for foreign countries one has to know"]],[3724,["that it is one of the major things that they have in the West,"]],[3729,["because they think lustful life is the only life worth living."]],[3733,["Beyond that is Shiva."]],[3736,["And that’s why we have to understood that, we have to understand"]],[3742,["that in our heart,"]],[3745,["the reflection of Shiva is only possible in complete form"]],[3751,["when we have cleaned our heart."]],[3753,["To have malice for others,"]],[3755,["to have lust for others,"]],[3759,["to have anger for others,"]],[3764,["to have envy for others,"]],[3768,["all these reactions within us act,"]],[3771,["and our heart becomes like a stone,"]],[3774,["it cannot reflect."]],[3777,["So, if you have to reflect the quality of Shiva,"]],[3780,["which is very important today, in this Kali Yuga..."]],[3784,["Very, there are very few people who are really reflecting"]],[3789,["the image of Shiva in their own character."]],[3794,["So, it is important to watch yourself"]],[3797,["and see for yourself what’s wrong with you:"]],[3799,["\"Where am I? Where is my attention going?"]],[3802,["Where am I going? What am I doing?\","]],[3804,["if you go on judging yourself and not others."]],[3809,["Also, one of the western things is that,"]],[3812,["they have a right to criticize others, everybody."]],[3818,["\"I like it, I don’t like it”."]],[3820,["Who are you? Why do you say such a thing?"]],[3823,["Somebody had made a beautiful, say, arrangement for you;"]],[3827,["you sit in his house and nicely say:  “I don’t like it”,"]],[3831,["to hurt that person."]],[3835,["After all, who are you?"]],[3837,["What do you think of yourself?"]],[3839,["Who are you to judge?"]],[3841,["For Sahaja Yoga, Yogis, is prohibited"]],[3844,["to say, “I like” and “I don’t like.”"]],[3848,["It's prohibited."]],[3850,["Look at Shiva. He likes everything."]],[3854,["What He wears? Also snakes."]],[3858,["He likes all kinds of animals."]],[3860,["Every type of thing"]],[3862,["that we think is not good, ugly, for Him they are not."]],[3866,["For example, in His wedding He took with Him, in His bharat,"]],[3871,["people who were all infirm,"]],[3874,["some people had one leg,"]],[3876,["some people had limbs broken down,"]],[3880,["some had only one eye."]],[3882,["All such people He carried with them."]],[3885,["To Him, these people were very dear"]],[3888,["and He looked after them,"]],[3890,["because He is the source of joy."]],[3893,["He is the One who gives us joy"]],[3895,["and the One that makes us joyous."]],[3898,["The real joy is only possible"]],[3900,["if in your heart His reflection is there."]],[3904,["But if your heart is full of all things,"]],[3907,["then once I have described,"]],[3909,["it becomes a dirty, very, very dirty mirror."]],[3915,["Very surprising, I told them also,"]],[3917,["that compared to Indians, Westerners are not so particular -"]],[3921,["Western Sahaja Yogis - are not so particular about their comfort."]],[3926,["Though they come from a very materialistic surrounding,"]],[3929,["they are not so much bothered."]],[3930,["They can live anywhere, they can be happy anywhere."]],[3933,["That’s a very good stage they have reached"]],[3936,["and that’s what’s the Indians must try to follow."]],[3939,["And don’t pay attention to nonsensical things."]],[3942,["It is not necessary to waste your energy on nonsensical thing."]],[3947,["Then only you can have a real bhakti for your Self, for your Atma"]],[3954,["and that is what needed today,"]],[3956,["that your Spirit should shine in your character, in your behavior"]],[3962,["and in your personality."]],[3965,["If that happens, then you have achieved,"]],[3968,["what Sahaja Yoga wanted to do for you."]],[3972,["It's important today, very important."]],[3975,["If you read the newspapers, you can’t read it."]],[3978,["And what you need is to change - the transformation -"]],[3983,["as we in Hindi call it ‘pariwartan’"]],[3986,["of human beings into Selfhood, into Self-awareness,"]],[3991,["into the Spirit."]],[3993,["This has to be done,"]],[3995,["and the time has come this evolutionary process has started."]],[3998,["There are so many of them who have got it."]],[4000,["Now the old saints and people who were gurus, real gurus,"]],[4007,["they used to really test the disciples"]],[4013,["by making them stand on their heads for years together,"]],[4017,["sometimes put them in the water, do all kinds of things."]],[4022,["They used to beat them"]],[4024,["and they were very harsh, testing all of them."]],[4028,["And then only, one of them used to get Realization."]],[4033,["Now, what I thought of:"]],[4036,["\"It takes too much time to cleanse them,"]],[4040,["to put them into all kinds of dresses, this that,"]],[4045,["send them to Himalayas or to Gobi Desert."]],[4050,["I thought it will take too much time."]],[4052,["I said why not first enlighten them, give them the light?"]],[4057,["In that light they can see their problems"]],[4059,["and they will themselves correct themself."]],[4061,["They will be their own guru."]],[4063,["And it was successful. It was good."]],[4067,["Now you can see for yourself what you are doing,"]],[4070,["what is your problem, what makes you so much different from others"]],[4077,["and what will elevate you."]],[4080,["Because Sadashiva’s place is above the head,"]],[4085,["above your thoughts, above your mind,"]],[4088,["above your emotions."]],[4090,["It’s here."]],[4091,["And you have to cross this limit."]],[4094,["Only when you do not react to things,"]],[4096,["and also to you nothing is important than Shiva,"]],[4103,["then only it will work out."]],[4105,["So, in some things Indians have to learn,"]],[4108,["and in some things you foreigners have to learn."]],[4112,["So many things you have done, I must thank you very much."]],[4115,["People used to think that I cannot do anything."]],[4117,["I mean you have given up drinking,"]],[4119,["you have given up all kinds of bad habits,"]],[4122,["you are no more womanizers, your attention is so clean."]],[4125,["So many things you have done, which is really praise-worthy."]],[4128,["But still,"]],[4130,["you must learn that still there are certain things lingering,"]],[4134,["which must be cleared out"]],[4136,["and must be absolutely finished."]],[4139,["You don’t have very much politics"]],[4142,["but sometimes there is also politics, group forming is there."]],[4146,["All this has to go away."]],[4148,["Because for Shiva, what is this? The whole universe is at His feet."]],[4152,["To Him to have a one group here and a one group there,"]],[4157,["all that doesn’t matter."]],[4159,["To Him, it doesn’t come into His head, you see."]],[4163,["For a person like a very big ocean, it touches many shores."]],[4168,["But in itself it is a big ocean."]],[4171,["In the same way is Shiva principle."]],[4173,["And you all should develop that principle of Shiva."]],[4177,["And then see the joy."]],[4179,["the joy of this great ocean of love."]],[4184,["May God bless you."]]]);
